[code-00034] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When using `reportlab` for multi-page documents, define a canvas callback function (e.g., `add_page_number`) and pass it to the `onFirstPage` and `onLaterPages` arguments of the `doc.build()` method to ensure headers and 'Page X of Y' footers appear on every page. For definitions, use a `Paragraph` with a `ParagraphStyle` that includes `leftIndent` and `firstLineIndent` to visually separate terms from explanatory text.
